            "review_title": "Review at Com Hien Nhi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Daniel K\nWarsaw, Poland72 contributions\n0\nTrue Vietnamese food in tourist city\nMar 2016 • Couples\nWe've searched good, true Vietnamese food. In Nha Trang were are a lot of tourist - a special Russians - it's hard to find it. It's like 1,2 from city center but it's worth to walk to it. In restaurant were only locals so food is good. We've ate squid in tempura and in salad, frog and shrimps. All ingredients were fresh.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 5, 2016",
