            "review_title": "Review at Com Hien Nhi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "BernieGuernsey\nGuernsey, United Kingdom48 contributions\n0\nGood food and value for money\nFeb 2016 • Couples\nWe stumbled across this place whilst walking around Nha Trang on the first evening of our stay and noticed not only how busy it was but that the majority of people eating were Vietnamese so thought we would give it a go.\nThe menu is mainly Vietnamese cuisine and there is a comprehensive choice. The quantity and quality of the food and the service was good, that coupled with the value for money meant we visited on three occasions trying different foods each time and thoroughly enjoyed them. We would have no hesitation in recommending Hien Nhi and should we return to Nha Trang would definitely visit again.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
